格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"The design skill for Claude Code, Cursor and any coding agent. Stop shipping AI-slop UI: turn it into shippable, tasteful frontend. Install: npx skills add superdesigndev/superdesign-skill. Powered by superdesign.dev","id":"gh:1139329853","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"superdesign-skill","slug":"superdesigndev/superdesign-skill","topics":["agent-skills","ai-design","claude-code","claude-skill","claude-skills","coding-agent","cursor","design-agent","dsh-plugin","frontend","superdesign","ui-design","ux-design"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"The design skill for Claude Code, Cursor and any coding agent. Stop shipping AI-slop UI: turn it int"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"o shippable, tasteful frontend. Install: npx skills add superdesigndev/superdesign-skill. Powered by"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"teful frontend. Install: npx skills add superdesigndev/superdesign-skill. Powered by superdesign.dev"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Superdesign: UI, presentations, and graphics for coding agents"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Stop shipping AI-slop UI.** Coding agents write great code and mediocre interfaces: generic layout"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"s, default shadcn everything, no taste. Superdesign is the skill that gives your agent design judgme"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"nt, so the UI it ships actually looks considered."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Install it once and your agent (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and 70+ others) can find real design dir"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ection and generate + iterate high-quality UI, presentations, and graphics on an infinite canvas, al"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"l without leaving your terminal."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> Powered by superdesign.dev, the AI product design agent."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"*▶ Watch the skill in action.*"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## What is Superdesign?"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Superdesign is an AI product design agent.** It gives coding agents (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, a"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"nd 70+ others) real design judgment, so the UI they ship looks considered instead of generic."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **What it does** — finds design direction, sets up design systems, approves presentation outlines,"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" and generates + iterates high-quality UI, slide decks, and graphics on an infinite canvas.\n- **Who "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"it's for** — developers, indie hackers, and product/UI designers who want to go from idea to shippab"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"le UI fast without leaving their coding agent.\n- **How it's different** — style-preset skills just s"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"wap in a theme or a component library. Superdesign designs *into* your existing design system: it re"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ads your code for context, gathers real style references, and produces branchable drafts you refine."},{"id":"p9s7","text":"\n- **Cross-session continuity** — after the first real-codebase design, the skill remembers the proj"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"ect, draft, extracted components, and budgeted source-context bundle so later unchanged iterations r"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"esume without repeating codebase discovery.\n- **Two ways in** — this skill from any coding agent, or"},{"id":"p9s10","text":" the web app at superdesign.dev."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> **Not the legacy IDE extension.** The archived open-source `superdesigndev/superdesign` VS Code ex"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"tension is an older, separate project. This skill and superdesign.dev are the current, maintained pr"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"n is an older, separate project. This skill and superdesign.dev are the current, maintained product."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Any coding agent** — installs the skill for any of the 70+ supported coding agents:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**Claude Code** — install it as a plugin instead, so it stays namespaced and updates with `/plugin u"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"e Code** — install it as a plugin instead, so it stays namespaced and updates with `/plugin update`:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The skill is then invoked as `/superdesign:superdesign`. (Do not also run `npx skills add` in Claude"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" Code — that installs a second, unnamespaced copy of the same skill.)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Either way, install the CLI it drives:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Use it"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Just talk to your agent:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The skill handles the rest: it reads your code for context, gathers real style references, and produ"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ces design drafts you can branch and refine."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"# Core scenarios (what this skill handles)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"1. **Design or improve UI** (feature/page/flow)\n2. **Create a presentation** with an editable approv"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ed outline\n3. **Create graphics** (posters, covers, social posts, and ads)\n4. **Set or extract a des"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ign system**\n5. **Generate supporting images or video**"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Tooling overview"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### A) Inspiration & Style Tools (generic, always available)"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Use these to discover style direction, references, and brand context. Browse the full prompt library"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" in the web app, or query it from the CLI:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- **Search prompt library** (style/components/pages)"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- **Get prompt details** — read the compact index first, then fetch the full body only for the slug("},{"id":"p33s2","text":"mpt details** — read the compact index first, then fetch the full body only for the slug(s) you pick"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- **Extract a site's design DNA from a URL** (style guide, tokens, content, brand, clone)"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Overall SOP for designing features on top of existing app:\n1. Investigate existing UI, workflow\n2"},{"id":"p37s2","text":". Setup design system file if not exist yet\n3. Requirements gathering: ask the user using the sessio"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"n's available user-input mechanism; if none is available, ask in chat (optionally use Inspiration to"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"ols when needed)\n4. Ask user whether ready to design in superdesign OR implement UI directly\n5. If y"},{"id":"p37s5","text":"es to superdesign\n5.1 Create/update a pixel perfect html replica of current UI of page that we will "},{"id":"p37s6","text":"design on top of in `.superdesign/replica_html_template/<name>.html` (html should only contain & ref"},{"id":"p37s7","text":"lect how UI look now, the actual design should be handled by superdesign agent)\n5.2 Create project w"},{"id":"p37s8","text":"ith this replica html + design system guide\n5.3 Start desigining by iterating & branching design dra"},{"id":"p37s9","text":"ft based on designDraft ID returned from project"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"# 2) Designing X (feature/page/flow)"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"### Example workflow - Add feature to existing page"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"1. Investigate the existing design and ask targeted questions about requirements and taste using the"},{"id":"p40s2","text":" session's available user-input mechanism; if none is available, ask in chat\n2. After clarifying, As"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"k user whether ready to design in superdesign OR implement UI directly\n3. If design in superdesign\n3"},{"id":"p40s4","text":".1 Ensure `.superdesign/design-system.md` exists (setup if missing)\n3.2 Identify page most relevant,"},{"id":"p40s5","text":" and build a pixel-perfect replica in replica_html_template:\n- `.superdesign/replica_html_template/<"},{"id":"p40s6","text":"page>-<feature>.html`\n3.3 Create project, seeding the baseline draft from the replica HTML template "},{"id":"p40s7","text":"(returns `draftId`):"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"→ Note: `draftId` in the response is the baseline draft. The design system is passed as a `--context"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"-file` on the iterate step below, not on `create-project`.\n3.4 Branch designs from baseline (use `dr"},{"id":"p42s3","text":"aftId` from step 3.3)"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"3.5 Share design title & preview URL → collect feedback → iterate"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
